Cell[TextData[{
 "The viewer uses ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraFiberedGraphHighlight"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraFiberedGraphHighlight", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9449c610-60a1-4087-b121-fa021529286e"],
 " and accepts the same object list, style grammar and options. Graph \
structure and styling options apply to the total view. Image size, \
background, labels and text styling also apply to the base view; its \
coordinates and layout use the base-specific options. The total graph appears \
on the left and the reconstructed base on the right. The result is a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["DynamicModule"]], "paclet:ref/DynamicModule"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "273b1c15-c812-4f50-83f1-07e9669881f8"],
 ". For a list of options, supply the item list explicitly, as in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"InfraFiberedGraphViewer", "[", 
   RowBox[{"fib", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<3DFiber\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b34bfbce-0f88-49b3-9a48-3e17636c1e59"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"460294d8-7ebc-4ef8-b49c-8e0a8afa7e36"],

Cell["\<\
Hover a total vertex or a base vertex to highlight its fiber and the supplied \
section values in that fiber.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ea97e3be-9a85-470d-8503-26855c802add"],

Cell["\<\
Hover a base edge to highlight the supplied sections and connection edges \
above that edge.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"0e87bec5-685e-4376-994b-3b5d47ec5f80"],

Cell["\<\
Supplied sections and connections retain their individual identity; several \
objects are not combined into one mathematical section or connection.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8b691736-cd94-4c16-92af-74507e47c5e7"],

Cell["\<\
A walk retains its repeated visits and traversals through the shared \
highlighting operation.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"64247299-02f1-4c3c-855e-e68d7488abfc"],

Cell["\<\
The viewer materializes the supplied structure and its layout when created. \
Hovering changes highlights only. It never calls a random section, connection \
or fibration sampler.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"275bf4b3-0e4c-4bfb-a450-f9bd1168663a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Method"]], "paclet:ref/Method"},
